# Claude worktrees: they are FULL COPIES of the repo inside the repo. Git already
# excludes them (.git/info/exclude) and so does ESLint, but Prettier does not, so
# a `prettier --write .` would reformat thousands of files from another branch.
.claude/

# Generated by `sync-kon-schema`, and REGENERATED when the tests run. The
# generator does not emit Prettier style, so `format:check` flagged it right
# after every `pnpm test` and the `qa` gate could not stay green. The
# style of a file nobody edits by hand is not Prettier's call.
*.generated.ts

